{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109353","id":2724128764,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6iXuf8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109353","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109353.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109353.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109353","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109353/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109353/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109353/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/395dcb0c0c30ffca5452decb3f5e89c76778bfc6","number":109353,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Allow selecting disabled items in `ItemList`","user":{"login":"sydist","id":81040138,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQwMTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81040138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist","html_url":"https://github.com/sydist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Disabled items in ItemList can now be focused and selected (if their `selectable` property is enabled), but cannot be activated.\r\n\r\n**Why:**\r\nPreviously, disabling an item completely blocked it from being selected, clicked, or navigated to. This made the `selectable` and `disabled` properties redundant in practice.\r\n\r\nThis behavior was also inconsistent with other standard GUI controls (like `Button`), which can still receive focus outline so they can be read, but cannot be activated (pressed). This change makes `ItemList` navigation more intuitive and consistent, allowing keyboard and screen-reader users to navigate to and read disabled options, while ensuring they cannot trigger actual item activation.\r\n\r\n**Behavior changes to consider:**\r\n    - Keyboard navigation (arrow keys/page keys) will no longer skip disabled items.\r\n    - In Single-Selection mode, selecting a disabled item (via click or arrow keys) will now emit `item_selected` and `item_clicked` signals.\r\n    - In Single-Selection mode, calling `is_selected(index)` on a disabled item can now return true if the user has navigated to it.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"htt